#: 28f2cc15524b450884fe3de57d567f97
msgid "Jittor 2.0 Migration Notes"
msgstr "计图 2.0 迁移说明"

#: 0c524126f84542048acc0863f7af4bae
msgid "Breaking Changes"
msgstr ""

#: dc44920de0354d4db1423e3ca65a1130
msgid "`jittor.vcompiler` retired"
msgstr ""

#: 0f8de33c63c44447baa04915d0b335a5
msgid ""
"Jittor 2.0 removes the experimental `jittor.vcompiler` package and its "
"`build()` decorator. Importing that package compiled a private C++ static-"
"graph extension as a side effect, and the API had no in-repository consumer "
"or stable compatibility contract. Source checkouts and installed wheels now "
"both report no module specification for `jittor.vcompiler`."
msgstr ""

#: 889166ca8799403a9cc6dcd456f97706
msgid ""
"There is no drop-in replacement for its cached static-graph decorator. Use "
"normal Jittor graph execution for model code. Extension authors who need a "
"custom operation should use the maintained `jittor.compile_custom_op` or "
"`jittor.compile_custom_ops` interfaces and explicitly test forward and "
"backward behavior on each supported backend."
msgstr ""

#: c9c3d6c79b7f499fafd45efd5c5e8f8e
msgid "Repository-only payload moved out of the wheel"
msgstr ""

#: 02dcdb049f3641f1a19a6989f1697f1c
msgid ""
"Operational scripts, release utilities, examples, and notebooks now live "
"under root `tools/` and `examples/`. They remain available in the source "
"distribution but are no longer importable members of the runtime wheel. "
"Installed-environment validation uses `python -m jittor.selftest`."
msgstr ""

#: 70ba3067f7b74b8ca810093a46819f87
msgid ""
"MyST Markdown under `examples/notebooks/` is the canonical tutorial source. "
"Generated `.ipynb` files are no longer versioned or shipped in the source "
"distribution; `python -m nox -s tutorials` materializes them in external "
"state and runs the maintained offline CPU smoke set."
msgstr ""

#: e08f1694ab6e419a838b522e922afe72
msgid ""
"The legacy Clang pass under `jittor/extern/llvm` and the callable "
"`jittor.compiler.compile_extern()` are not removed in this release stage. "
"Their retirement is deferred until the Linux/Clang cold-compilation gate "
"passes."
msgstr ""
